@startuml mill-desktop
title Desktop mill
left to right direction
actor Electron
rectangle "Pool, gateway, or node" as Target
rectangle "DATUM Gateway" as Gw
rectangle "federationcoind" as Node
rectangle "DATUM Prime" as Prime
Electron --> Target : TCP Stratum or node RPC
Target ..> Gw
Gw --> Node : GBT submitblock
Gw --> Prime : DATUM only
note bottom of Electron
  No WSS required.
  Host a pool stays Prime spawn.
end note
@enduml
